AutoG is a front end for GGIR. It does not contain or modify GGIR's code; the built bundle
includes the unmodified GGIR 3.3-8 source package from CRAN.

GGIR: Raw Accelerometer Data Analysis. van Hees V, Migueles J, Sabia S, Patterson M, Fang Z,
Heywood J, Capdevila Pujol J, Kushleyeva L, Chen M, Yerramalla M, Bos P, Sanders T, Zhao C,
Meneghel Danilevicz I, Barreto Mesquita V, Segantin G, Afolabi S, and contributors.
Licensed under the Apache License 2.0. doi:10.5281/zenodo.1051064
https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR

The built bundle also contains R for Windows (GPL-2 | GPL-3) and the R packages listed in
packages.lock, each under its own licence, recorded in its DESCRIPTION file.

Icons: Font Awesome Free (via the R package fontawesome), icons under CC BY 4.0.
